Two-stage IR:

High-level IR (HIR) — close to AST, resolves control flow, desugaring, type-checked, annotated with hotness and allocation constraints. HIR ops include CALL_INTRIN, RPC_BATCH, PAR_SIMD, TX_TEMPLATE_BUILD.

