LD_CONST r1, <val>

CALL r2, INTRIN_find_arb, r1, r3

VEC_SIMD r4, r5, r6

TX_BUILD r9, template_id

BUNDLE_SUBMIT builder_id, r9

HIR → optimization passes (inlining, fold constants, escape analysis, loop unrolling) → LIR.

